  "description": "Replacement of single glazed windows throughout the property with new slim-line heritage 4-4-4 double glazed timber casement window to match existing. Existing roof repaired and insulated, existing roof tiles rehung. Existing downpipes and rainwater goods replaced with new cast iron goods to existing locations. External hard landscaping resurfaced with natural stone pavers and lower patio enlarged. New EV charging point to side elevation. New ground floor, single storey rear extension. GF layout reconfigured within the BOH outrigger block. Original doorway between Kitchen and Entrance Hall reinstated. GF floor structure levelled and repaired, existing parquet timber floor relaid. FF bathrooms reconfigured and refurbished. General internal refurbishment, and upgrading of heating, electric and plumbing systems throughout the property.",
